=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Nantoto} at H-8 in {z:Lower Jeuno}.
* Activate the {p:Records of Eminence} quest under Other -> RoE Quests -> Grudge to get credit.
* Defeat one {m:Yagudo High Priest} in {z:Castle Oztroja}.
** The priest is through the trap door at the top of the castle.
** Refer to the {p:Brass Statue} page for passwords that allow access to the Yagudo High Priest's area.
** The {p:sparks|Sparks} and {p:EXP|Experience Points} are awarded at this point. This objective can be completed as a {p:monipulator|Category:Monstrosity} if you wish to obtain the EXP for a monster rather than a job.
* Return to {n:Nantoto} for a cutscene and your reward.

=2 To Unlock the additional Quests
* After completing this quest, speak to {n:Duberasson} in {z:Western Adoulin} near the Mog House Sparks NPC. He mentions becoming a {p:White Mage}, {q:Petals of Recollection|Petals of Recollection|Petals of Recollection}, and {n:Nantoto}.
** Speaking with {n:Duberasson} is required to unlock the {p:vorseal|Vorseal}.
* After that dialogue, speak to {n:Nantoto} in {z:Lower Jeuno} to unlock new RoE Quests based on your total number of {p:Records of Eminence} objectives completed.
